---
import Diagram from '../Diagram.astro';
---
<Diagram caption={"Two lifecycles. Records move from PostgreSQL to Parquet and stay; files stay in the bucket as uploaded and can be given a lifetime."}>
<svg viewBox="0 0 970 460" role="img" aria-labelledby="life-t life-d" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<title id="life-t">Lifecycle of a record and of a file</title>
<desc id="life-d">A record is ingested, lives hot in PostgreSQL, and after the hot window is archived to Parquet, where it can no longer be deleted. A file is described, uploaded to a presigned URL, committed after a size and digest check, and optionally expires and is deleted by the cleanup job, or deleted at any time by an admin.</desc>
<defs>
<marker id="life-a" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" class="arrow-fill"/></marker>
<marker id="life-ac" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" class="arrow-accent"/></marker>
</defs>
<text x="20" y="30" class="t-h" text-anchor="start">RECORD (JSON payload)</text><rect x="20" y="50" width="190" height="80" rx="8" class="box"/><text x="115" y="77" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">Ingested</text><text x="115" y="95" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">POST /objects or</text><text x="115" y="113" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">POST /tables/&#123;t&#125;/records</text><rect x="300" y="50" width="190" height="80" rx="8" class="box-hot"/><text x="395" y="77" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">Hot</text><text x="395" y="95" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">row in PostgreSQL,</text><text x="395" y="113" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">daily partition</text><rect x="580" y="50" width="190" height="80" rx="8" class="box-cold"/><text x="675" y="77" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">Archived</text><text x="675" y="95" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">hourly Parquet file</text><text x="675" y="113" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">in the bucket + binding</text><polyline points="210,90 300,90" class="edge-accent" marker-end="url(#life-ac)"/><text x="255" y="80" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">validate, route</text><polyline points="490,90 580,90" class="edge-accent" marker-end="url(#life-ac)"/><text x="535" y="66" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">archive job</text><text x="535" y="120" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">after HOT_DAYS</text><line x1="395" y1="130" x2="395" y2="175" class="edge-dash"/><g class="x"><line x1="385" y1="178" x2="405" y2="198"/><line x1="405" y1="178" x2="385" y2="198"/></g><text x="420" y="192" class="t-muted" text-anchor="start">DELETE /objects/&#123;id&#125; removes it (admin)</text><g class="x"><line x1="675" y1="178" x2="695" y2="198"/><line x1="695" y1="178" x2="675" y2="198"/></g><line x1="685" y1="130" x2="685" y2="175" class="edge-dash"/><text x="705" y="192" class="t-muted" text-anchor="start">409: archived records are immutable</text><text x="800" y="80" class="t-b" text-anchor="start">Reads see both tiers</text><text x="800" y="100" class="t-muted" text-anchor="start">as one table; archive files</text><text x="800" y="118" class="t-muted" text-anchor="start">are verified on every read.</text><text x="20" y="250" class="t-h" text-anchor="start">FILE (any bytes)</text><rect x="20" y="270" width="160" height="80" rx="8" class="box"/><text x="100" y="297" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">Described</text><text x="100" y="315" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">POST /objects</text><text x="100" y="333" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">row, upload URL</text><rect x="210" y="270" width="160" height="80" rx="8" class="box"/><text x="290" y="297" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">Uploaded</text><text x="290" y="315" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">PUT to the</text><text x="290" y="333" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">presigned URL</text><rect x="400" y="270" width="160" height="80" rx="8" class="box-cold"/><text x="480" y="297" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">Committed</text><text x="480" y="315" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">size + SHA-256</text><text x="480" y="333" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">checked, downloadable</text><rect x="590" y="270" width="160" height="80" rx="8" class="box"/><text x="670" y="297" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">Expired</text><text x="670" y="315" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">expires_at passed</text><text x="670" y="333" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">(if retention_days)</text><rect x="780" y="270" width="160" height="80" rx="8" class="box"/><text x="860" y="297" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">Deleted</text><text x="860" y="315" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">bucket object, then</text><text x="860" y="333" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">catalog row</text><polyline points="180,310 210,310" class="edge-accent" marker-end="url(#life-ac)"/><polyline points="370,310 400,310" class="edge-accent" marker-end="url(#life-ac)"/><polyline points="560,310 590,310" class="edge-accent" marker-end="url(#life-ac)"/><polyline points="750,310 780,310" class="edge-accent" marker-end="url(#life-ac)"/><text x="195" y="262" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">client</text><text x="385" y="262" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">client</text><text x="575" y="262" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">clock</text><text x="765" y="262" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">cleanup job</text><polyline points="100,350 100,395 865,395 865,350" class="edge-dash" marker-end="url(#life-a)"/><text x="480" y="388" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">abandoned before commit, or DELETE /objects/&#123;id&#125; at any time (admin)</text><text x="480" y="430" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">Cleanup deletes at most 500 files per run (more: true means run it again). A bucket failure keeps the row, so the next run retries.</text>
</svg>
</Diagram>
